      "writtenOn": "2025-12-02T12:27:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah but in what situation would we want to isolate a CPU?\nIt seems like this is for some kind of low power mode, but it wasn\u0027t clear to me when this mode would actually trigger.",
      "parentUuid": "030757be_0db25b93",
      "revId": "586352d88170cd89f6d40f08fc6c7e848eaa6bfa",
