      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, makes sense, thanks.\n\nMy main concern with this CL is that it\u0027s a 2 year old change that hasn\u0027t been sent upstream again since, as far as I could find. I hope another attempt is made.\n\n(I think the same behavior could also be achieved in a different way, by updating nohz.idle_cpus_mask, but I don\u0027t feel too strongly about that.)",
